    "body": "Builds only the minimal ZORR execution base.\n\nScope:\n- add one canonical `ZORR_EXECUTION_CONSTITUTION.md`\n- require it at every agent/session boot through `AGENTS.md`\n- encode the recurring OWNER laws: truth/fresh evidence, study-first, reuse-first, do-not-write-it-yourself without a proven gap, simplest sufficient system, no treading water, root cause before fix, base-first, product-first, bounded self-heal, fail-closed, durable terminal state\n- add a regression test so CI fails if the Constitution disappears or is detached from agent bootstrap\n- explicitly keep OWNER learning/profile OUT of this base\n\nNo BRAINSTORM agent implementation. No OWNER preference claims. No product/canon/runtime changes.\n\nBase main at start: `ab816ff383c74d1c72ee36df31bc381cf062f52b`.",
